# File Size Limit
RULE: File 900 lines max (warn 700). Split by SRP when exceeded. Quality gates enforce.
WHY: Single Responsibility Principle; maintainability.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/file-splitting-guide.md, quality-gates-service-template.sh
DO: Split by pipeline stage, domain, or operation; extract helpers; update imports
NEVER: Add noqa or exclude to bypass; commit files >900 lines
